<!--
  Arabic (Modern Standard Arabic) translation of values/strings.xml — S41.
  Key set mirrors the English file one-to-one (app_name stays untranslated:
  it is translatable="false" there). Placeholders (%1$s, %1$d) are preserved
  exactly. Identifier-like arguments (seat ids, room codes, uids, dates,
  version names) are wrapped in Unicode isolates (FSI U+2068 … PDI U+2069)
  so the Latin text cannot reorder the Arabic around it. Draft for native-
  speaker review; terminology choices are listed in the S41 review inventory.
-->
